
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Login | Shortly</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 24px;
            font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            color: #edf2ff; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top left, #272454, #0b1020 65%);
        }
        .layout { width: 100%; max-width: 980px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            background: #11182bd9; border: 1px solid #ffffff16; border-radius: 26px;
            overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 30px 100px #0006; }
        .visual { padding: 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #28265b, #171c3b 70%, #151b30); min-height: 580px; }
        .brand { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: -1px; color: white; text-decoration: none; }
        .brand span { color: #a5b4fc; }
        .visual-content { margin: 70px 0; }
        .tag { color: #c4b5fd; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .visual h2 { font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 43px); line-height: 1.13; letter-spacing: -1.5px; margin: 18px 0; }
        .visual p { color: #b7c0db; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 14px; max-width: 340px; }
        .mini-card { border: 1px solid #ffffff24; background: #ffffff0a; border-radius: 14px; padding: 16px; }
        .mini-label { font-size: 11px; color: #aeb9d6; margin-bottom: 9px; }
        .mini-url { color: #c4b5fd; font-weight: 650; font-size: 14px; }
        .form-side { padding: 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
        .form-side h1 { font-size: 30px; letter-spacing: -1px; }
        .subtitle { color: #9ba8c1; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 10px 0 30px; }
        .group { margin-bottom: 19px; }
        label { display: block; color: #d7def0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 650; margin-bottom: 9px; }
        input { width: 100%; padding: 14px; color: white; background: #0b1121; border: 1px solid #303b57; border-radius: 11px; outline: none; font: inherit; }
        input:focus { border-color: #818cf8; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #818cf81c; }
        input::placeholder { color: #69758f; }
        .forgot { display: block; text-align: right; color: #a5b4fc; text-decoration: none; font-size: 12px; margin: -3px 0 22px; }
        .submit { width: 100%; border: 0; padding: 14px; border-radius: 11px; background: linear-gradient(100deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6); color: white; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; }
        .submit:hover { filter: brightness(1.08); }
        .footer { color: #9ba8c1; text-align: center; margin-top: 25px; font-size: 13px; }
        .footer a { color: #c4b5fd; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; }
        .footer a:hover, .forgot:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        .error { color: #fda4af; background: #3a1b2b; border: 1px solid #713044; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px; margin-bottom: 18px; font-size: 13px; }
        @media (max-width: 720px) {
            .layout { max-width: 440px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .visual { display: none; }
            .form-side { padding: 35px 26px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="layout">
        <section class="visual">
            <a href="/login" class="brand">shortly<span>.</span></a>
            <div class="visual-content">
                <div class="tag">Less link. More impact.</div>
                <h2>Every link has a story.</h2>
                <p>Create memorable short links, keep your workspace organized, and understand how people engage with your content.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mini-card">
                <div class="mini-label">YOUR NEXT SHORT LINK</div>
                <div class="mini-url">shortly.app/your-next-big-thing ↗</div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="form-side">
            <h1>Welcome back</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Sign in to your Shortly workspace and pick up where you left off.</p>

            <% if (typeof error !== "undefined" && error) { %>
                <div class="error" role="alert"><%= error %></div>
            <% } %>

            <form action="/user/login" method="POST">
                <div class="group">
                    <label for="email">EMAIL ADDRESS</label>
                    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email" required>
                </div>
                <div class="group">
                    <label for="password">PASSWORD</label>
                    <input type="password" id="password" name="password" placeholder="Enter your password" autocomplete="current-password" required>
                </div>
                <a class="forgot" href="/forgot-password">Forgot password?</a>
                <button class="submit" type="submit">Sign in to Shortly&nbsp; →</button>
            </form>
            <p class="footer">New to Shortly? <a href="/signup">Create an account</a></p>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
